                                                "text": "Near-synonyms: see Thesaurus:fastidious"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b9623514-e9f6-4951-8e74-184b0b2963aa",
                                                "sense_id": "6bbf199e-95f2-3049-adf4-a0e3c6f3c173",
                                                "text": "Our wines will satisfy even the most demanding of connoisseurs."
